he time left on the cycle, minus a credit for the old price over that same time. ",[248,1204,1205],{},"false"," charges the full new price for the current cycle on top of what was already paid. ",[1092,1208,1209,1211],{},[248,1210,1205],{}," does not skip the charge:"," use ",[248,1214,1215],{},"prorationCharge"," for that. Ignored when ",[248,1218,1215],{}," is ",[248,1221,1205],{},[227,1223,1224,1228,1232],{},[245,1225,1226],{},[248,1227,1215],{},[245,1229,1230],{},[248,1231,320],{},[245,1233,1234,1235,1237,1238,1240,1241,414,1244,414,1247,414,1250,1252,1253,1255,1256,280],{},"Whether an immediate change is charged at all (default ",[248,1236,1198],{},"). With ",[248,1239,1205],{},", the change applies now and nothing is charged for it: a downgrade gets no credit. The next renewal bills the new price, unless a change is already scheduled for that renewal: that change still applies. During a trial, the trial keeps running and its end bills the new plan. Sending ",[248,1242,1243],{},"invoiceImmediately: true",[248,1245,1246],{},"anchor",[248,1248,1249],{},"resetAnchor",[248,1251,581],{}," or a plan with a different interval with ",[248,1254,1205],{}," returns ",[248,1257,1258],{},"422",[227,1260,1261,1266,1270],{},[245,1262,1263],{},[248,1264,1265],{},"applyImmediately",[245,1267,1268],{},[248,1269,320],{},[245,1271,1272,1273,1275,1276,1278],{},"Apply the change now (",[248,1274,1198],{},") or at the end of the current period (",[248,1277,1205],{},", default).",[227,1280,1281,1286,1290],{},[245,1282,1283],{},[248,1284,1285],{},"invoiceImmediately",[245,1287,1288],{},[248,1289,320],{},[245,1291,1292,1293,1295,1296,1298,1299,1301,1302,1304,1305,1311],{},"Generate and charge a proration invoice immediately. Only applies when ",[248,1294,1265],{}," and ",[248,1297,1188],{}," are both ",[248,1300,1198],{},". Defaults to ",[248,1303,1205],{},", which parks the proration delta on the current cycle and bills it as a line on the next renewal invoice (and waives it if the sub